talents.full_description:
After each long rest, choose one damage type:
Bludgeoning;
Piercing;
Slashing.
While holding Martial Focus and wearing no Heavy armor, reduce damage of the chosen type by your Proficiency Bonus when it is dealt by a nonmagical weapon, natural weapon, or Unarmed Strike.
At CL 10+, you may choose Force as the damage type if the damage comes from a physical impact or martial technique.

When your Unarmed Strike would reduce a creature to 0 HP, you may leave it at 1 HP and choose one:
knock it Prone;
Grapple it if you have a free hand and it is a legal target;
prevent it from taking Reactions until the end of its next turn;
immediately move 5 feet without provoking Opportunity Attacks from it.
When you use Merciful Hand, regain Martial Focus if absent.

